This directory contains selected Chinese community documentation snapshots from:

- Tomato ROS Autoware Documentation Chinese community translation: https://github.com/tomato-ros/autoware-documentation-cn

The current and historical snapshots are pinned by commit in corpus_manifest.json. The repository is licensed under Apache-2.0. Its Chinese translation is community-maintained and is not an official Autoware translation.

This project is an independent demonstration and is not affiliated with the Autoware Foundation or Tomato ROS.
